cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these bounds or this verification code, please cite it."
title: "Kissing numbers: new lower bounds in dimensions 18 through 96, with verification packages"
abstract: >-
  Verification packages for constructive kissing-number lower bounds in 70
  dimensions: 18, 25-46, 49-71 and 73-96. The 25 November 2026 repository
  snapshot records the constructions, exact checks, inherited inputs and
  source-attributed comparisons. An entry in the registry is not necessarily
  the current world record; later external constructions are identified
  separately. The paper and PDF retain their earlier 66-result checkpoint
  documented in common/manuscript_scope.json.
